function important_page_default_body(string $slug): string
{
    $defaults = [
        'about' => '<div class="page-hero-content"><span class="page-kicker">About The Platform</span><h2>About GYAN RANK</h2><p>GYAN RANK is a digital education operations and visibility platform built to help institutions manage structured records, verification workflows, ranking participation, reporting, and trusted public-facing information.</p></div><div class="highlight-band"><div><strong>Operational Platform</strong><span>Built for registrations, student workflows, fees, records, and reporting.</span></div><div><strong>Structured Verification</strong><span>Supports disciplined data handling and institutional trust workflows.</span></div><div><strong>Subscription Service</strong><span>Offers digital access, implementation support, and operational modules.</span></div></div><div class="content-grid"><section><h3>Who We Serve</h3><p>GYAN RANK is designed for schools, colleges, degree colleges, universities, institutes, coaching centres, students, parents, and authorised administrative teams that need a structured education workflow environment.</p></section><section><h3>What The Platform Provides</h3><p>The platform supports institution registration, profile setup, academic workflow modules, fee and payment handling, student and guardian data management, verification support, reports, rankings, and public visibility tools.</p></section><section><h3>Service Model</h3><p>GYAN RANK operates as a digital subscription and service platform. Depending on the selected plan or engagement, customers may receive access to dashboards, onboarding support, implementation assistance, and related digital services.</p></section></div><div class="split-showcase"><section><span class="card-kicker">Platform Positioning</span><h3>Built to combine institutional operations, disciplined records, and public credibility in one system.</h3><p>The platform is intended to help institutions maintain structured academic and administrative workflows rather than relying only on fragmented manual processes.</p></section><section><h3>Digital workflow support</h3><p>Registration, student records, academic configuration, fees, and reporting modules.</p><h3>Trust-oriented architecture</h3><p>Supports verification, role-based access, and structured institutional information handling.</p><h3>Commercial support channels</h3><p>Institutions can contact the team for onboarding, subscriptions, implementation, and business enquiries.</p></section></div>',
        'pricing' => '<div class="page-hero-content"><span class="page-kicker">Starter, Gold, Diamond</span><h2>Pricing & Membership</h2><p>Choose the access level for School/College, Degree College, or Institute/Coaching Center. Starter keeps owner access free, Gold opens full CRM, and Diamond gives every user their own login.</p></div><div class="highlight-band"><div><strong>Starter</strong><span>Free owner/admin access with limited dashboard, public listing, and upgrade-ready setup.</span></div><div><strong>Gold</strong><span>Full CRM for students, admissions, fees, certificate, online verification, admit card, and results.</span></div><div><strong>Diamond</strong><span>CRM plus staff, teacher, parent, student access, topper gallery, and landing page control.</span></div></div><div class="content-grid"><section><span class="card-kicker">CRM Modules</span><h3>Gold Plan Working</h3><p>Owner/admin can manage admissions, students, class/course, batches, fee collection, dues, receipts, reports, certificates, online verification, admit cards, and results from one CRM dashboard.</p></section><section><span class="card-kicker">User Access</span><h3>Diamond Plan Working</h3><p>Staff, teacher, parent, and student panels unlock with notices, downloads, result view, admit card access, topper gallery, and complete institution landing page control.</p></section><section><span class="card-kicker">All Categories</span><h3>One Plan Model</h3><p>The same Starter, Gold, and Diamond logic works for School/College, Degree College, and Institute/Coaching Center with category-wise modules.</p></section></div><section class="policy-note"><h3>Important Subscription Rule</h3><p>All plans are subscription-based. A subscription may be stopped at any time for future billing, but no refund is provided for payments already made.</p></section>',
        'schools' => '<div class="page-hero-content"><span class="page-kicker">Institution Directory</span><h2>Institution Directory</h2><p>Search School/College, Degree College, and Institute/Coaching Center profiles with ranking visibility, location filters, and direct admission enquiry access.</p></div><div class="highlight-band"><div><strong>Verified Directory</strong><span>Browse category-wise institution modules.</span></div><div><strong>Grid View / List View</strong><span>Switch between discovery cards and a more compact browsing mode.</span></div><div><strong>Admissions Ready</strong><span>Every profile includes a direct admission enquiry shortcut for fast action.</span></div></div><div class="split-showcase"><section><span class="card-kicker">Verified Directory</span><h3>Browse category-wise institution modules</h3><p>Filter by category, affiliation, state, and district. Public profiles stay aligned with each institution dashboard and ranking module.</p></section><section><h3>School / College</h3><p>Classes, staff, fees, admissions, ranking.</p><h3>Degree College</h3><p>Departments, programs, semesters, faculty.</p><h3>Institute / Coaching Center</h3><p>Courses, batches, trainers, learners.</p></section></div>',
        'ranking' => '<div class="page-hero-content"><span class="page-kicker">Category-wise Ranking Search</span><h2>Ranking Results</h2><p>Search year-wise ranking for School/College, Degree College, and Institute/Coaching Center modules using category, geography, and affiliation filters.</p></div><div class="highlight-band"><div><strong>Current results</strong><span>Current results returned for the selected filter set.</span></div><div><strong>Select Scope</strong><span>Ranking scope changes automatically based on your chosen geography.</span></div><div><strong>Year-wise</strong><span>Year-wise ranking visibility requires recompute for the selected session.</span></div></div><div class="split-showcase"><section><span class="card-kicker">Search Filters</span><h3>Find ranking results</h3><p>Select institution category, geography, and academic year to load latest computed public ranking data.</p></section><section><span class="card-kicker">Results</span><h3>Published ranking list</h3><p>No results yet. Select State or District and make sure ranking has been recomputed for this year.</p></section></div>',
        'leaderboard' => '<div class="page-hero-content"><span class="page-kicker">Leaderboard</span><h2>State Leaderboard</h2><p>Select scope and view top schools. Requires Admin recompute for the year.</p></div><div class="content-grid"><section><h3>Scope</h3><p>State, District, and Block scope filters help visitors browse ranking visibility by geography.</p></section><section><h3>Scope Item</h3><p>Choose the state, district, or block item for which leaderboard records should be viewed.</p></section><section><h3>Results</h3><p>No data. Choose scope item and ensure ranking computed.</p></section></div>',
        'contact' => '<div class="page-hero-content"><span class="page-kicker">Support & Enquiries</span><h2>Contact Us</h2><p>Use the official support channels below for onboarding, subscriptions, billing questions, implementation support, cancellation requests, refund clarifications, and business enquiries.</p></div><div class="split-showcase"><section><span class="card-kicker">Official Support Details</span><h3>For fastest resolution, contact us through the registered phone and email channels below.</h3><p>Please include your institution name, registered mobile number, email address, and payment or subscription reference when contacting us for service-related support.</p></section><section><h3>Onboarding & service support</h3><p>For setup, dashboard access, module support, student workflow, or implementation queries.</p><h3>Billing & policy queries</h3><p>For cancellation, subscription, renewal, payment, or refund-policy clarification.</p><h3>Business enquiries</h3><p>For enterprise, partnership, sponsorship, or commercial discussions.</p></section></div><div class="content-grid"><section><h3>Support Phone</h3><p><a href="tel:+91-8299442665">+91-8299442665</a></p><p>Business-hours support for service, onboarding, billing, and account assistance.</p></section><section><h3>Support Email</h3><p><a href="mailto:support@gyanrank.in">support@gyanrank.in</a></p><p>Use for account support, implementation help, cancellation requests, and policy clarification.</p></section><section><h3>Business Email</h3><p><a href="mailto:business@gyanrank.in">business@gyanrank.in</a></p><p>For proposals, enterprise onboarding, sponsorship, and commercial communication.</p></section></div><div class="content-grid"><section><h3>Support Scope</h3><ul><li>Institution registration and onboarding support</li><li>Subscription and billing assistance</li><li>Cancellation and refund-policy clarification</li><li>Implementation, workflow, and dashboard support</li><li>Business and partnership enquiries</li></ul></section><section><h3>Response Guidance</h3><p>Response time may vary based on request type, verification requirements, business hours, and available documentation. For faster handling, please use the same phone number or email address used during registration or billing.</p></section></div>',
        'privacy' => '<div class="page-hero-content"><span class="page-kicker">Legal & Compliance</span><h2>Privacy Policy</h2><p>This Privacy Policy explains how GYAN RANK collects, uses, stores, shares, and protects information provided through the website, dashboards, forms, subscription flow, and related services.</p></div><p class="policy-note">Effective Date: 26 March 2026</p><div class="legal-wrap"><section><h3>1. Information We Collect</h3><ul><li>Institution details such as name, type, contact information, affiliation, location, and profile content.</li><li>User details such as name, email address, mobile number, role, login credentials, and support communication data.</li><li>Student and parent/guardian related records submitted by authorised institutions for workflow and verification purposes.</li><li>Payment, billing, subscription, and transaction-related records required for service operations.</li><li>Technical data such as browser information, access logs, IP-related activity, and security events.</li></ul></section><section><h3>2. How We Use Information</h3><p>We use collected information to provide and operate the platform, process registrations, verify users, manage subscriptions, support dashboards, generate reports, deliver ranking workflows, improve service quality, communicate with users, and maintain platform security.</p></section><section><h3>3. Legal And Operational Basis</h3><p>Information is processed where necessary for service delivery, contract performance, user account management, legitimate platform operations, fraud prevention, compliance, or user-authorised submissions through the platform.</p></section><section><h3>4. Data Sharing</h3><p>We do not sell personal information. Data may be shared only where reasonably required with payment processors, cloud providers, communication partners, technical service providers, compliance advisors, or lawful authorities, strictly for service, security, or legal purposes.</p></section><section><h3>5. Data Security</h3><p>We use reasonable administrative, technical, and operational safeguards to protect information against unauthorised access, misuse, or loss. However, no online system can guarantee absolute security, and users must also keep credentials confidential.</p></section><section><h3>6. Data Retention</h3><p>We retain data for as long as necessary to provide services, maintain records, support audits, resolve disputes, meet legal obligations, or preserve platform integrity. Certain records may remain archived where operational or regulatory retention is required.</p></section><section><h3>7. Cookies And Technical Signals</h3><p>The platform may use session technologies, security controls, and analytics tools to maintain login sessions, prevent abuse, improve performance, and measure service usage.</p></section><section><h3>8. User Rights And Corrections</h3><p>Users may contact us to request correction of inaccurate contact details or account information. Institution-submitted records should generally be updated by the authorised institution administrator responsible for those records.</p></section><section><h3>9. Children And Student Data</h3><p>Student-related records submitted through the platform are expected to be uploaded only by authorised institutions or authorised guardians/parents as applicable. Institutions remain responsible for ensuring proper authorisation and lawful handling of such data.</p></section><section><h3>10. Contact For Privacy Queries</h3><ul><li>Support Email: <a href="mailto:support@gyanrank.in">support@gyanrank.in</a></li><li>Business Email: <a href="mailto:business@gyanrank.in">business@gyanrank.in</a></li><li>Support Phone: <a href="tel:+91-8299442665">+91-8299442665</a></li></ul></section></div>',
        'account-delete-policy' => '<h2>Account Delete Policy</h2><p>Users can request account deletion by contacting support. After verification, eligible personal data will be removed or anonymized according to operational and legal requirements.</p>',
        'cancellation-policy' => '<div class="page-hero-content"><span class="page-kicker">Legal & Compliance</span><h2>Cancellation Policy</h2><p>This policy explains how customers may stop future billing or request service cancellation for subscription-based services offered on GYAN RANK.</p></div><p class="policy-note">Effective Date: 26 March 2026</p><div class="legal-wrap"><section><h3>1. Cancellation Of Future Billing</h3><p>A customer may request cancellation of future subscription renewals by contacting the official support team through the details published on the Contact Us page.</p></section><section><h3>2. Effective Date Of Cancellation</h3><p>Cancellation generally applies to future billing cycles. The current paid period may continue until the end of the active service term unless otherwise specifically confirmed by the platform in writing.</p></section><section><h3>3. No Automatic Refund</h3><p>Cancellation does not automatically trigger a refund. Refunds, if any, are governed strictly by the Refund Policy and only after internal review where applicable.</p></section><section><h3>4. How To Request Cancellation</h3><ul><li>Share institution name or account identity.</li><li>Provide registered email address or phone number.</li><li>Provide payment or subscription reference where available.</li><li>Request cancellation before the next billing cycle where possible.</li></ul></section><section><h3>5. Suspension Or Platform Closure</h3><p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts for fraud, misuse, unauthorised activity, non-payment, security risk, or legal non-compliance. Such action may occur without creating a refund obligation.</p></section><section><h3>6. Contact For Cancellation Requests</h3><ul><li>Support Phone: <a href="tel:+91-8299442665">+91-8299442665</a></li><li>Support Email: <a href="mailto:support@gyanrank.in">support@gyanrank.in</a></li><li>Business Email: <a href="mailto:business@gyanrank.in">business@gyanrank.in</a></li></ul></section></div>',
        'refund-policy' => '<div class="page-hero-content"><span class="page-kicker">Legal & Compliance</span><h2>Refund Policy</h2><p>GYAN RANK follows a strict non-refundable billing policy for activated subscription plans, onboarding charges, implementation fees, service fees, and related digital service payments.</p></div><p class="policy-note">Effective Date: 26 March 2026</p><div class="legal-wrap"><section><h3>1. General Refund Position</h3><p>All payments made toward subscriptions, onboarding, setup, implementation, training, activation, custom work, service fees, and other approved charges are non-refundable once paid.</p></section><section><h3>2. Active Billing Cycle</h3><p>If a subscription has already started or a service period is active, the amount paid for that billing cycle will not be refunded, whether or not the service is fully used by the customer.</p></section><section><h3>3. No Refund On Cancellation</h3><p>Cancellation of service or stopping future billing does not create any right to a refund for the current or any completed billing cycle.</p></section><section><h3>4. Duplicate Or Excess Payment Review</h3><p>If a customer believes that a duplicate payment or clearly excess payment was made by mistake, the customer may contact support for review. Any review will be subject to payment verification, gateway confirmation, and internal approval. This does not guarantee a refund.</p></section><section><h3>5. Payment Disputes</h3><p>Users should contact the official support team first for billing clarification before initiating any external payment dispute. We may request transaction reference details, payment screenshots, and account identifiers for investigation.</p></section><section><h3>6. Contact For Billing Support</h3><ul><li>Support Phone: <a href="tel:+91-8299442665">+91-8299442665</a></li><li>Support Email: <a href="mailto:support@gyanrank.in">support@gyanrank.in</a></li><li>Business Email: <a href="mailto:business@gyanrank.in">business@gyanrank.in</a></li></ul></section></div>',
        'cancellation-refund' => '<div class="page-hero-content"><span class="page-kicker">Legal & Compliance</span><h2>Cancellation & Refund Policy</h2><p>This page combines the GYAN RANK Cancellation Policy and Refund Policy for subscription-based services, onboarding charges, implementation fees, service fees, and related digital service payments.</p></div><p class="policy-note">Effective Date: 26 March 2026</p><div class="legal-wrap"><section><h3>Cancellation Policy</h3><p>This policy explains how customers may stop future billing or request service cancellation for subscription-based services offered on GYAN RANK.</p></section><section><h3>1. Cancellation Of Future Billing</h3><p>A customer may request cancellation of future subscription renewals by contacting the official support team through the details published on the Contact Us page.</p></section><section><h3>2. Effective Date Of Cancellation</h3><p>Cancellation generally applies to future billing cycles. The current paid period may continue until the end of the active service term unless otherwise specifically confirmed by the platform in writing.</p></section><section><h3>3. No Automatic Refund</h3><p>Cancellation does not automatically trigger a refund. Refunds, if any, are governed strictly by the Refund Policy and only after internal review where applicable.</p></section><section><h3>4. How To Request Cancellation</h3><ul><li>Share institution name or account identity.</li><li>Provide registered email address or phone number.</li><li>Provide payment or subscription reference where available.</li><li>Request cancellation before the next billing cycle where possible.</li></ul></section><section><h3>5. Suspension Or Platform Closure</h3><p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts for fraud, misuse, unauthorised activity, non-payment, security risk, or legal non-compliance. Such action may occur without creating a refund obligation.</p></section><section><h3>Refund Policy</h3><p>GYAN RANK follows a strict non-refundable billing policy for activated subscription plans, onboarding charges, implementation fees, service fees, and related digital service payments.</p></section><section><h3>1. General Refund Position</h3><p>All payments made toward subscriptions, onboarding, setup, implementation, training, activation, custom work, service fees, and other approved charges are non-refundable once paid.</p></section><section><h3>2. Active Billing Cycle</h3><p>If a subscription has already started or a service period is active, the amount paid for that billing cycle will not be refunded, whether or not the service is fully used by the customer.</p></section><section><h3>3. No Refund On Cancellation</h3><p>Cancellation of service or stopping future billing does not create any right to a refund for the current or any completed billing cycle.</p></section><section><h3>4. Duplicate Or Excess Payment Review</h3><p>If a customer believes that a duplicate payment or clearly excess payment was made by mistake, the customer may contact support for review. Any review will be subject to payment verification, gateway confirmation, and internal approval. This does not guarantee a refund.</p></section><section><h3>5. Payment Disputes</h3><p>Users should contact the official support team first for billing clarification before initiating any external payment dispute. We may request transaction reference details, payment screenshots, and account identifiers for investigation.</p></section><section><h3>6. Contact For Billing Support</h3><ul><li>Support Phone: <a href="tel:+91-8299442665">+91-8299442665</a></li><li>Support Email: <a href="mailto:support@gyanrank.in">support@gyanrank.in</a></li><li>Business Email: <a href="mailto:business@gyanrank.in">business@gyanrank.in</a></li></ul></section></div>',
        'terms-and-conditions' => '<div class="page-hero-content"><span class="page-kicker">Legal & Compliance</span><h2>Terms & Conditions</h2><p>These Terms & Conditions govern access to and use of the GYAN RANK platform, website, dashboards, subscription services, onboarding support, and related digital services.</p></div><p class="policy-note">Effective Date: 26 March 2026</p><div class="legal-wrap"><section><h3>1. Platform Overview</h3><p>GYAN RANK is a digital education infrastructure platform that provides institution registration, verification workflows, student data management, dashboards, analytics, ranking participation, reporting, and related subscription-based software services.</p><p>For legal, billing, payment gateway, and compliance reference, the platform is operated under the responsible name <strong>RACHANA DEVI</strong>.</p><p>The platform may be used by schools, colleges, degree colleges, universities, institutes, coaching centres, parents, students, authorised staff, and approved administrators subject to these Terms.</p></section><section><h3>2. Acceptance Of Terms</h3><p>By accessing, registering on, subscribing to, or using GYAN RANK, you agree to be bound by these Terms, our Privacy Policy, Refund Policy, and Cancellation Policy.</p><p>If you do not agree with these Terms, you should not use the platform or make any payment for the services.</p></section><section><h3>3. Eligibility And Authority</h3><p>Any person completing institution registration, subscription, or onboarding confirms that they are authorised to act on behalf of the relevant institution or account holder.</p><p>Users must provide accurate registration details, maintain current information, and ensure that all submitted records are lawful and properly authorised.</p></section><section><h3>4. Account Responsibilities</h3><ul><li>Users are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of login credentials.</li><li>Users are responsible for all activity carried out through their account or dashboard access.</li><li>Institutions must ensure that authorised staff use the platform only for legitimate academic, administrative, or verification purposes.</li></ul></section><section><h3>5. Data Accuracy And Conduct</h3><p>Users must not upload false, misleading, forged, defamatory, unlawful, or unauthorised data. Institutions are responsible for the correctness of student records, staff records, verification inputs, and public profile information submitted through the platform.</p><p>We reserve the right to suspend, restrict, or remove access where misuse, fraud, manipulation, or policy breach is detected.</p></section><section><h3>6. Subscription, Billing, And Renewals</h3><p>GYAN RANK offers subscription-based digital services. Pricing, plan scope, billing cycle, and service activation may vary depending on the selected package, onboarding model, or commercial arrangement.</p><p>Services may include recurring billing. By making payment, the customer authorises processing of applicable charges for the selected plan or approved service scope.</p></section><section><h3>7. Cancellation And Refund Position</h3><p>Cancellation requests may stop future billing in accordance with the Cancellation Policy. However, all payments already paid for a live or current billing cycle remain non-refundable, subject to the Refund Policy published on this website.</p><p>No refund is created merely because a user stops using the service, changes plan preference, or requests cancellation after service activation.</p></section><section><h3>8. Service Availability</h3><p>We aim to keep the platform available and secure, but uninterrupted access cannot be guaranteed. Maintenance, upgrades, security controls, internet issues, third-party provider issues, or force majeure events may affect service availability from time to time.</p></section><section><h3>9. Intellectual Property</h3><p>The GYAN RANK name, platform design, workflows, software, content structure, data presentation, visual assets, and related materials remain the property of the platform owner or its licensors unless expressly stated otherwise.</p><p>No user may copy, distribute, reverse engineer, resell, or commercially exploit the platform or its materials without prior written permission.</p></section><section><h3>10. Limitation Of Liability</h3><p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, GYAN RANK shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or data-related losses arising from platform use, delay, interruption, user error, third-party misuse, or inaccurate data supplied by institutions or users.</p></section><section><h3>11. Suspension Or Termination</h3><p>We may suspend or terminate access where there is non-payment, misuse, fraudulent conduct, unauthorised access, policy breach, legal risk, or platform security concern. Platform records may be retained where required for compliance, audit, or legal purposes.</p></section><section><h3>12. Contact</h3><p>For service, billing, compliance, or legal queries, users may contact us through the official support details published on the Contact Us page.</p><ul><li>Support Phone: <a href="tel:+91-8299442665">+91-8299442665</a></li><li>Support Email: <a href="mailto:support@gyanrank.in">support@gyanrank.in</a></li><li>Business Email: <a href="mailto:business@gyanrank.in">business@gyanrank.in</a></li></ul></section></div>',
    ];

    return $defaults[$slug] ?? '<h2>Page</h2><p>Content will be updated soon.</p>';
